{"v":4,"catch":"冬天了，貓咪還在外面，又冷又孤單。找到牠們，帶牠們回家吧。","desc":"打開車子和箱子，在木材堆中翻找，搜索森林。貓咪很會躲，但牠們在你靠近時會喵喵叫，所以要仔細聽，你或許能把牠們全都找出來。\n\n有 12 種以上的迷人冬季地貌，還有超過 120 隻小貓咪可以找噢。","publisher":"Silesia Games","release":"2022-01-27","genres":["冒險","益智","派對","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","葡萄牙文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文","荷蘭文","俄文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.6GB / Switch 0.6GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d7f719d169565a22e82c36b7b91962fcf7cb07e405f1925ddd2c2b825e1468a7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/decb4117c074d456986f485e38252058387d68f725b917561166aca764a2d76c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f22ae924c7a009ba8bbdabc749767a820cc04c6cd5f39beeacb8936b40343103.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dbc158a344f86dbaa72deaf0ae57cfddd96d47fb721294ebf195f53a7031f856.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c01b25c02de4ffa68a69c0ab3a24fe13dcb2815da37dfc8e1724bcc7577dafe9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/25048eca8f2b3f469a4a8325c2fd310044a4864d3ebb5684752dc656d556155b.jpg"],"titleId":"01005e90160e0000","dlc":[]}